ed for comparison against ViCo.'], 'source_chunk_index': [9]}, 'RefCOCO+': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ['A dataset used for evaluating the localization accuracy of different word embeddings.'], 'source_chunk_index': [10]}, 'localization accuracy': {'type': ['task'], 'description': ['The task of determining the precise location of objects within an image, used for evaluating the performance of word embeddings.'], 'source_chunk_index': [10]}, 'MAt-tNet': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A method used for comparing localization accuracy with different embeddings on the RefCOCO+ dataset.'], 'source_chunk_index': [10]}, 'zero-shot classification': {'description': ['A task used to evaluate the performance of ViCo, assessing its ability to generalize to unseen visual data.', 'A task used to evaluate the performance of ViCo, assessing its ability to generalize to unseen visual data.', 'A task used to evaluate the performance of ViCo, assessing its ability to generalize to unseen visual data.', 'A task used to evaluate the performance of ViCo, assessing its ability to generalize to unseen visual data.', 'A task used to evaluate the performance of ViCo, assessing its ability to generalize to unseen visual data.', "A task used to evaluate ViCo's performance, representing a zero-shot-like visual generalization task.", "A task used to evaluate ViCo's performance, representing a zero-shot-like visual generalization task.", "A task used to evaluate ViCo's performance, representing a zero-shot-like visual generalization task.", "A task used to evaluate ViCo's performance, representing a zero-shot-like visual generalization task.", "A task used to evaluate ViCo's performance, representing a zero-shot-like visual generalization task.", 'A task used to evaluate the performance of ViCo, assessing its ability to generalize to unseen visual data.', 'The task used to evaluate embeddings on the CIFAR-100 dataset.'], 'type': ['task'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6